{"3003650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Where is the Tutorial", "steam_appid": 3003650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/6566fd902f71b826bec64c1987b1b2f1.avif?t=1788117250\" width=880 height=86 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brief introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you tired of easy, satisfying games, that make you feel complete and at peace with yourself?</strong> Here at Olympic Hamster &amp; Co. have found a simple solution to your non-existing problem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I put together a game, removed every single instruction that the player would actually need to comprehend the actual objectives and directions, and presented it right to you. Have a great time with paper made characters while figuring out the rules to beat every level, each more difficult and complex than the last one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/517774069896ac4d387c6b65f5bc20d1.poster.avif?t=1788117250\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/517774069896ac4d387c6b65f5bc20d1.webm?t=1788117250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/517774069896ac4d387c6b65f5bc20d1.mp4?t=1788117250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>At the same time you will be welcomed at the <strong>DCA</strong>! A security company that uses drones to make the world a safer place. As you learn how to play you will also be rising through their ranks and unveiling the secrets this suspicious company might or might not have. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope this helps you get a positive first impression of a game where I need to say as little as possible in order to maintain the game experience fresh and new for every player. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/b53f4deac65cbd08d5e3ff7109e1230b.avif?t=1788117250\" width=892 height=96 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pros to buying the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe the brief introduction was not enough, but don't worry, I also felt something missing. So instead I decided to go for a more in depth list of reasons for you to get you trying out this masterpiece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigeons.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is still not much info about the game isn't there? You know, probably you could check the achievements, but I got ahead and also made them quite unclear... So let me try doing reverse engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/822d27638471c88b49767cbc49a48dcc.avif?t=1788117250\" width=874 height=84 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cons to buying the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here I will try to make clear the audience I <strong>DO NOT WELCOME </strong>playing my game, which is also a key part of the game itself, as this way I will avoid negative reviews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who hate pigeons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay now I feel confident. At least I made sure to say everything I wanted to pitch about this giant abomination (in which I definitely wasn't just lazy to create a tutorial).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/e38672baf8a5a415a297f960b0572970.poster.avif?t=1788117250\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/e38672baf8a5a415a297f960b0572970.webm?t=1788117250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/e38672baf8a5a415a297f960b0572970.mp4?t=1788117250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/6566fd902f71b826bec64c1987b1b2f1.avif?t=1788117250\" width=880 height=86 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brief introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you tired of easy, satisfying games, that make you feel complete and at peace with yourself?</strong> Here at Olympic Hamster &amp; Co. have found a simple solution to your non-existing problem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I put together a game, removed every single instruction that the player would actually need to comprehend the actual objectives and directions, and presented it right to you. Have a great time with paper made characters while figuring out the rules to beat every level, each more difficult and complex than the last one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/517774069896ac4d387c6b65f5bc20d1.poster.avif?t=1788117250\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/517774069896ac4d387c6b65f5bc20d1.webm?t=1788117250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/517774069896ac4d387c6b65f5bc20d1.mp4?t=1788117250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>At the same time you will be welcomed at the <strong>DCA</strong>! A security company that uses drones to make the world a safer place. As you learn how to play you will also be rising through their ranks and unveiling the secrets this suspicious company might or might not have. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope this helps you get a positive first impression of a game where I need to say as little as possible in order to maintain the game experience fresh and new for every player. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/b53f4deac65cbd08d5e3ff7109e1230b.avif?t=1788117250\" width=892 height=96 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pros to buying the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe the brief introduction was not enough, but don't worry, I also felt something missing. So instead I decided to go for a more in depth list of reasons for you to get you trying out this masterpiece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigeons.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is still not much info about the game isn't there? You know, probably you could check the achievements, but I got ahead and also made them quite unclear... So let me try doing reverse engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/822d27638471c88b49767cbc49a48dcc.avif?t=1788117250\" width=874 height=84 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cons to buying the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here I will try to make clear the audience I <strong>DO NOT WELCOME </strong>playing my game, which is also a key part of the game itself, as this way I will avoid negative reviews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who hate pigeons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay now I feel confident. At least I made sure to say everything I wanted to pitch about this giant abomination (in which I definitely wasn't just lazy to create a tutorial).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/e38672baf8a5a415a297f960b0572970.poster.avif?t=1788117250\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003650/extras/e38672baf8a5a415a297f960b0572970.webm?t=1788117250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar